  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.models.Quote\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Represents quote information sent from the service to the client in an ordering system. This data model encapsulates quote details including: unique quote ID, validity period, customer and dealer names, list of quoted items (QuoteItemInfo), pricing information (total cost and discount as an amount, not percentage), and delivery location (city, postal code, state). Key methods: validate() - validates required fields (dealerName, customerName) and returns JSON-formatted errors or null; addQuoteItem(sku, amount) - adds items to the quote list; copy constructor Quote(Quote) - creates a deep copy of an existing quote; standard getters/setters for all fields. The class provides custom equals() and hashCode() implementations for proper object comparison, with equals() performing deep comparison including sorted quote items arrays. Location fields are used for estimating delivery costs and capturing local regulatory information.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/models/Quote.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
